{"name":"Home Brew","hex":"#897b66","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"home brew","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative form of homebrew."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/home_brew"}],"entries":[{"title":"Home Brew (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Home Brew, also known as Home Brew Crew, is a New Zealand hip hop group."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Home_Brew%2C_Homegrown_festival%2C_Wellington%2C_2012.jpg/330px-Home_Brew%2C_Homegrown_festival%2C_Wellington%2C_2012.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Home_Brew_(band)","wikidata":"Q16844515"},{"title":"Home Brew (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Home Brew is the first studio album by New Zealand hip-hop group Home Brew. It was released by Young, Gifted & Broke on 1 May 2012. The album draws mainly from the genre of New Zealand hip hop, but is also jazz-influenced. Home Brew was promoted by a 48-hour-long release party and a six-show tour of New Zealand cities. The album was lauded by critics, and won the New Zealand Music Award for Best Urban/Hip Hop Album. It debuted top of the New Zealand Albums Chart."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/7/7e/Home_Brew_album.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Home_Brew_(album)","wikidata":"Q17022656"},{"title":"Homebrewing","blocks":[{"text":"Homebrewing is the brewing of beer or other alcoholic beverages on a small scale for personal, non-commercial purposes. Supplies, such as kits and fermentation tanks, can be purchased locally at specialty stores or online. Beer was brewed domestically for thousands of years before its commercial production although its legality has varied according to local regulation. Homebrewing is closely related to the hobby of home distillation, the production of alcoholic spirits for personal consumption, but home distillation is generally more tightly regulated."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/BREWFERM_Pils_Beer_Homebrewing_Kit.jpg/330px-BREWFERM_Pils_Beer_Homebrewing_Kit.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Homebrewing","wikidata":"Q1621599"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Home_Brew%2C_Homegrown_festival%2C_Wellington%2C_2012.jpg/500px-Home_Brew%2C_Homegrown_festival%2C_Wellington%2C_2012.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Home_Brew%2C_Homegrown_festival%2C_Wellington%2C_2012.jpg/500px-Home_Brew%2C_Homegrown_festival%2C_Wellington%2C_2012.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHome_Brew%2C_Homegrown_festival%2C_Wellington%2C_2012.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/7/7e/Home_Brew_album.jpg/250px-Home_Brew_album.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/7/7e/Home_Brew_album.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/7/7e/Home_Brew_album.jpg/250px-Home_Brew_album.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHome_Brew_album.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/BREWFERM_Pils_Beer_Homebrewing_Kit.jpg/500px-BREWFERM_Pils_Beer_Homebrewing_Kit.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/BREWFERM_Pils_Beer_Homebrewing_Kit.jpg/1280px-BREWFERM_Pils_Beer_Homebrewing_Kit.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaig